  "description": "await page.WaitForRask() in a Playwright for .NET test waits until a Rask page has settled: every event answered and its render on the page, every navigation landed, the connection open, what was typed sent. No sleeps, no DOM-quiet windows, no polling for spinners, and it settles on a live page that keeps pushing renders. Reads the runtime's data-rask-busy mark on html, on both the Server and the WebAssembly host. The Rask answer to Livewire's waitForLivewire() for Laravel Dusk.",
